Depends:
 ${shlibs:Depends},
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: Prevents system from idling while
 an audio source or audio sink is active
 .
 Holds a gnome-session idle inhibitor while any PulseAudio playback or
 recording stream is running, so both Regolith sessions stay awake while
 audio plays. It can also print whether audio is active, for status bars.
